{"autopublicacoes": [{"codigo": "8898995", "titulo": "EDITAL DE PREGÃO ELETRÔNICO Nº 267/2026", "data": "2026-11-09 14:19:16", "cod_registro_info_sfinge": "6D547BA847CD5CD4480D28AB386CAD8C583CDCB1", "municipio": "Jaraguá do Sul", "entidade": "Prefeitura municipal de Jaraguá do Sul", "categoria": "Licitações", "link": "https://diariomunicipal.sc.gov.br/?q=id:8898995", "texto": "<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n\n    <head>\n\n        <meta name=\"cp:revision\" content=\"5\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"extended-properties:AppVersion\" content=\"15.0000\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"dc:language\" content=\"pt-BR\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"meta:paragraph-count\" content=\"22\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"meta:word-count\" content=\"270\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"custom:ContentTypeId\" content=\"0x01010046D1D902F9AFB0458A156704A0C1878F\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"extended-properties:Application\" content=\"LibreOffice/7.4.7.2$Linux_X86_64 LibreOffice_project/40$Build-2\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"custom:ShareDoc\" content=\"false\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"custom:ScaleCrop\" content=\"false\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"dc:creator\" content=\"CLIENTE\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"xmpTPg:NPages\" content=\"1\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"dcterms:created\" content=\"2026-11-04T16:30:00Z\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"dcterms:modified\" content=\"2026-11-06T14:43:55Z\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"meta:character-count\" content=\"1677\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"custom:HyperlinksChanged\" content=\"false\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"extended-properties:Template\" content=\"Normal\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"meta:character-count-with-spaces\" content=\"1936\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"X-TIKA:Parsed-By\" content=\"org.apache.tika.parser.CompositeParser\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"X-TIKA:Parsed-By\" content=\"org.apache.tika.parser.DefaultParser\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"X-TIKA:Parsed-By\" content=\"org.apache.tika.parser.microsoft.ooxml.OOXMLParser\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"extended-properties:DocSecurityString\" content=\"None\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"extended-properties:TotalTime\" content=\"10\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"Content-Length\" content=\"7368716\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"meta:page-count\" content=\"1\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"custom:LinksUpToDate\" content=\"false\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"Content-Type\" content=\"application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document\"/>\n\n        <title>&#0;</title>\n\n    </head>\n\n    <body>\n        <p>\n            <img src=\"embedded:image1.jpeg\" alt=\"\"/>ESTADO DE SANTA CATARINA\n        </p>\n\n        <p>MUNIC&Iacute;PIO DE JARAGU&Aacute; DO SUL</p>\n\n        <p/>\n\n        <p/>\n\n        <p>\n            <b>EDITAL  </b>\n        </p>\n\n        <p>\n            <b>PREG&Atilde;O ELETR&Ocirc;NICO N&ordm; 267/2026</b>\n        </p>\n\n        <p>\n            <a name=\"_GoBack\"/>Processo Administrativo n&ordm; 0203040000.000365/2026-47\n        </p>\n\n        <p/>\n\n        <p>Este procedimento licitat&oacute;rio obedecer&aacute;, integralmente, &agrave; Lei Federal n&ordm; 14.133, de 1&ordm; de abril de 2021, ao Decreto Municipal n&ordm; 19.330/2025 e suas altera&ccedil;&otilde;es, bem como &agrave;s demais normas legais e regulamentares aplic&aacute;veis &agrave; mat&eacute;ria.</p>\n\n        <p/>\n\n        <p>\n            <b>\n                <u>OBJETO</u> - \n            </b>A presente licita&ccedil;&atilde;o tem por objeto a contrata&ccedil;&atilde;o de empresa(s) especializada(s) para o fornecimento e a instala&ccedil;&atilde;o de plataforma niveladora de doca autom&aacute;tica, destinada &agrave; adequa&ccedil;&atilde;o da infraestrutura log&iacute;stica e &agrave; otimiza&ccedil;&atilde;o das opera&ccedil;&otilde;es de carga e descarga de materiais, e o fornecimento e a instala&ccedil;&atilde;o de automatiza&ccedil;&atilde;o para port&atilde;o deslizante, sem v&iacute;deo porteiro, ambos destinados ao Almoxarifado Central, localizado na Rua Marina Frutuoso, n.&ordm; 740, Centro, Jaragu&aacute; do Sul/SC, contemplando o fornecimento de equipamento novo, incluindo transporte, instala&ccedil;&atilde;o, testes de funcionamento e demais servi&ccedil;os necess&aacute;rios &agrave; sua plena operacionaliza&ccedil;&atilde;o, conforme especifica&ccedil;&otilde;es constantes do Anexo I &ndash; Termo de Refer&ecirc;ncia e demais anexos deste Edital.\n        </p>\n\n        <p/>\n\n        <p/>\n\n        <p>\n            <b>\n                <u>VALOR M&Aacute;XIMO DA CONTRATA&Ccedil;&Atilde;O</u>:\n            </b> R$27.448,33 (vinte e sete mil, quatrocentos e quarenta e oito reais e trinta e tr&ecirc;s centavos).\n        </p>\n\n        <p>\n            <b/>\n        </p>\n\n        <p>\n            <b/>\n        </p>\n\n        <p>\n            <b>\n                <u>DIA/HOR&Aacute;RIO</u>: \n            </b>\n        </p>\n\n        <p>\n            <b>LOCAL: </b>\n            <a href=\"http://www.portaldecompraspublicas.com.br/\">\n                <b>www.portaldecompraspublicas.com.br</b>\n            </a>  \n            <b> </b>\n        </p>\n\n        <p>\n            <b>IN&Iacute;CIO DO RECEBIMENTO DE PROPOSTA: 10/11/2026 &ndash; Horas 08:00:00</b>\n        </p>\n\n        <p>\n            <b>T&Eacute;RMINO DO RECEBIMENTO DE PROPOSTA: 23/11/2026 &ndash; Horas 08:00:00</b>\n        </p>\n\n        <p>\n            <b>IN&Iacute;CIO DA SESS&Atilde;O P&Uacute;BLICA: 23/11/2026 &ndash; Horas 08:15:00</b>\n        </p>\n\n        <p>\n            <b>REFER&Ecirc;NCIA DE TEMPO: Ser&aacute; observado o hor&aacute;rio de Bras&iacute;lia. </b>\n        </p>\n\n        <p>\n            <b>SISTEMA: PORTALDECOMPRASPUBLICAS.COM.BR</b>\n        </p>\n\n        <p>\n            <b>MODO DE DISPUTA: ABERTO</b>\n        </p>\n\n        <p/>\n\n        <p>\n            <b>\n                <u>FORMALIZA&Ccedil;&Atilde;O DE ESCLARECIMENTO e IMPUGNA&Ccedil;&Atilde;O AO EDITAL</u>: \n            </b>dever&aacute; ser realizada \n            <b>\n                <u>SOMENTE</u>\n            </b> \n            <b>na forma eletr&ocirc;nica</b>, via sistema PORTAL DE COMPRAS P&Uacute;BLICAS, \n            <b>sendo a data limite at&eacute; 17/11/2026 &agrave;s 23:59 horas</b>.\n        </p>\n\n        <p/>\n\n        <p>Jaragu&aacute; do Sul (SC), data da assinatura.</p>\n\n        <p/>\n\n        <p/>\n\n        <p/>\n\n        <p/>\n\n        <p/>\n\n        <table>\n            <tbody>\n                <tr>\t\n                    <td>\n                        <p>\n                            <b>ARGOS JOS&Eacute; BURGARDT</b>\n                        </p>\n\n                        <p>Secret&aacute;rio Municipal de Administra&ccedil;&atilde;o</p>\n\n                    </td>\n                </tr>\n\n            </tbody>\n        </table>\n\n        <p/>\n\n        <p>Edital de Preg&atilde;o Eletr&ocirc;nico n&ordm; 267/2026</p>\n\n        <p>1</p>\n\n    </body>\n</html>\n", "url": "https://diariomunicipal.sc.gov.br/arquivosbd/atos/2026/11/1794244714_267.2026__edital_aquisio_de_plataforma_niveladora__extrato_extrato.pdf"}, {"codigo": "8898970", "titulo": "AVISO DE LICITAÇÃO PROCESSO 212/2026 - ADM", "data": "2026-11-09 14:13:54", "cod_registro_info_sfinge": "AA284B0B4E0C01DE603C58722BBE88B627D5846B", "municipio": "São Carlos", "entidade": "Prefeitura municipal de São Carlos", "categoria": "Licitações", "link": "https://diariomunicipal.sc.gov.br/?q=id:8898970", "texto": "<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n\n    <head>\n\n        <meta name=\"cp:revision\" content=\"2\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"extended-properties:AppVersion\" content=\"15.0000\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"meta:paragraph-count\" content=\"2\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"meta:word-count\" content=\"185\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"extended-properties:Application\" content=\"Microsoft Office Word\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"meta:last-author\" content=\"11013\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"dc:creator\" content=\"giselia\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"extended-properties:Company\" content=\"\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"meta:print-date\" content=\"2016-01-15T13:53:00Z\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"xmpTPg:NPages\" content=\"1\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"dcterms:created\" content=\"2026-11-09T17:13:00Z\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"meta:line-count\" content=\"8\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"dcterms:modified\" content=\"2026-11-09T17:13:00Z\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"meta:character-count\" content=\"1000\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"extended-properties:Template\" content=\"Normal\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"meta:character-count-with-spaces\" content=\"1183\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"X-TIKA:Parsed-By\" content=\"org.apache.tika.parser.CompositeParser\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"X-TIKA:Parsed-By\" content=\"org.apache.tika.parser.DefaultParser\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"X-TIKA:Parsed-By\" content=\"org.apache.tika.parser.microsoft.ooxml.OOXMLParser\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"dc:title\" content=\"Estado de Santa Catarina\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"extended-properties:DocSecurityString\" content=\"None\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"Content-Length\" content=\"19111\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"meta:page-count\" content=\"1\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"Content-Type\" content=\"application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"dc:publisher\" content=\"\"/>\n\n        <title>Estado de Santa Catarina</title>\n\n    </head>\n\n    <body>\n        <table>\n            <tbody>\n                <tr>\t\n                    <td>\n                        <p> Estado de Santa Catarina</p>\n\n                        <p>\n                            <b>MUNICIPIO DE S&Atilde;O CARLOS</b>\n                        </p>\n\n                    </td>\n                </tr>\n\n                <tr>\t\n                    <td>\n                        <p/>\n\n                        <p>\n                            <b>EXTRATO AVISO DE LICITA&Ccedil;&Atilde;O </b>\n                        </p>\n\n                        <p/>\n\n                        <p>\n                            <u>Processo Administrativo n&ordm;</u> 212/2026 - ADM\n                        </p>\n\n                        <p>\n                            <u>Preg&atilde;o Eletr&ocirc;nico n&ordm;</u> 061/2026 - ADM\n                        </p>\n\n                        <p>\n                            <u>Tipo:</u> Menor Pre&ccedil;o por Item \n                        </p>\n\n                        <p>\n                            <u>Legisla&ccedil;&atilde;o</u>:  Lei n&ordm; 14.133/2021 \n                        </p>\n\n                        <p/>\n\n                        <p>\n                            <u>Objeto:</u>  \n                            <b>CONTRATA&Ccedil;&Atilde;O DE EMPRESA(S) ESPECIALIZADA(S) NA LOCA&Ccedil;&Atilde;O DE BRINQUEDOS INFL&Aacute;VEIS E EQUIPAMENTOS RECREATIVOS, COM DISPONIBILIZA&Ccedil;&Atilde;O DE MONITORES, PARA ATENDIMENTO AOS EVENTOS DAS SECRETARIAS MUNICIPAIS DE S&Atilde;O CARLOS/SC.</b>\n                        </p>\n\n                        <p/>\n\n                        <p>Data limite para cadastro de propostas: At&eacute; &agrave;s 08h00mim do dia 26 de novembro de 2026 (hor&aacute;rio de Bras&iacute;lia/DF). Abertura: dia 26 de novembro de 2026, &agrave;s 08h01min (hor&aacute;rio de Bras&iacute;lia/DF), ambos no endere&ccedil;o eletr&ocirc;nico: \n                            <a href=\"file:///C:/Users/Computador/Desktop/PUBLICA&Ccedil;&Otilde;ES/2021/www.portaldecompraspublicas.com.br\">www.portaldecompraspublicas.com.br</a>. \n                        </p>\n\n                        <p/>\n\n                        <p>O Edital e esclarecimentos poder&atilde;o ser obtidos no seguinte endere&ccedil;o e hor&aacute;rios: Rua Dem&eacute;trio L&oacute;renz, 747, nos dias &uacute;teis, de Segunda &agrave; Sexta, das 07:30 as 11:30 e das 13:30 &agrave;s 17:30 horas, ou pelo fone (49) 3325-3030.  \n                            <a href=\"https://saocarlos.atende.net\">https://saocarlos.atende.net</a> \n                        </p>\n\n                        <p/>\n\n                        <p/>\n\n                        <p>\n                            <a name=\"_GoBack\"/>SAO CARLOS/SC, 09 de outubro de 2026. \n                        </p>\n\n                        <p/>\n\n                        <p/>\n\n                        <p>\n                            <b>DELTON PAULO BALBINOT</b>\n                        </p>\n\n                        <p>\n                            <b>Prefeito </b>\n                        </p>\n\n                        <p/>\n\n                        <p/>\n\n                    </td>\n                </tr>\n\n            </tbody>\n        </table>\n\n        <p/>\n\n    </body>\n</html>\n", "url": "https://diariomunicipal.sc.gov.br/arquivosbd/atos/2026/11/1794244415_aviso_de_licitao_2122026__adm_extrato.pdf"}, {"codigo": "8898599", "titulo": "HOMOLOGAÇÃO PROCESSO ADMINISTRATIVO 117/2026 DISPENSA 59/2026", "data": "2026-11-09 12:04:08", "cod_registro_info_sfinge": "FF3E32C14F99D9EDB56F096A2680F0AE84C45CDA", "municipio": "Cordilheira Alta", "entidade": "Prefeitura municipal de Cordilheira Alta", "categoria": "Licitações", "link": "https://diariomunicipal.sc.gov.br/?q=id:8898599", "texto": "<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n\n    <head>\n\n        <meta name=\"pdf:PDFVersion\" content=\"1.6\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"xmp:CreatorTool\" content=\"Compras\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"pdf:docinfo:title\" content=\"Termo de Homologa&ccedil;&atilde;o e Adjudica&ccedil;&atilde;o (unificado)\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"pdf:hasXFA\" content=\"false\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"access_permission:modify_annotations\" content=\"true\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"access_permission:can_print_degraded\" content=\"true\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"dc:creator\" content=\"MUNICIPIO DE CORDILHEIRA ALTA - Claudia Hahn\"/>\n\n        <meta name=\"dcterms:created\" conte